    "title": "Ragdoll City Playground",
    "description": "Sequel to Ragdoll Playground, This game is a physics playground with ragdolls where you can smash a city with nuclear bombs, missiles, black holes, lasers, lightning or maybe summon monster recovery.\r\n\r\nBuildings have been designed to break realistically with excellent physics logic so you can witness the destruction created by these weapons realistically.\r\n\r\nDestruction isn't the only focus - build your own scenarios, test out new tools and weapons, and challenge yourself with a variety of missions and achievements. Prepare for countless hours of thrilling gameplay that will keep you hooked!",
